      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/90ced4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-30T21:57:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi to all,</p>\n<p>I’ve just buy SotM (from the far far away Italy) <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Which is the best/simplest startup configuration for a 4 or 5 player game?<br>\nWhich heroes, villain and environment?</p>\n<p>I have to explain rules and translating cards for players, so a “simple” or a “easy” configuration can help.</p>",
