      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-30T22:09:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think that if you start off playing against Baron Blade in Insula Primalis you will probably have a fairly easy time of explaining and translating the rules.  The heroes with less complicated rules to translate and explain probably include Ra, Tempest, Haka, Fanatic, and possibly Legacy.</p>\n<p>Good luck!  Let us know how it goes!</p>",
