      "created_at": "2011-08-30T22:48:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was going to suggest choosing Omnitron and either Megalopolis or Insula Primalis for the villain and environment respectively.</p>\n<p>As for the simplest heroes to play in a foreign language? Ra, Fanatic, The Wraith, Legacy and Tempest would be my suggestions.</p>",
